---

<div class="cooling-status">
    <div class="header">
        <h3>Estado de Sistemas de Enfriamiento</h3>
        <span class="status-badge">Optimizado</span>
    </div>

    <div class="towers-container">
        <div class="tower">
            <div class="tower-visual">
                <div class="fan spin"></div>
                <div class="water-flow level-80"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="tower-info">
                <h4>Torre A</h4>
                <div class="metric">
                    <span>Temp. Salida</span>
                    <span class="val">28°C</span>
                </div>
                <div class="metric">
                    <span>Flujo</span>
                    <span class="val">120 L/s</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tower">
            <div class="tower-visual">
                <div class="fan spin"></div>
                <div class="water-flow level-60"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="tower-info">
                <h4>Torre B</h4>
                <div class="metric">
                    <span>Temp. Salida</span>
                    <span class="val warning">31°C</span>
                </div>
                <div class="metric">
                    <span>Flujo</span>
                    <span class="val">95 L/s</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ai-insight">
            <div class="insight-icon">✨</div>
            <div class="insight-text">
                <strong>Sugerencia IA:</strong> Reducir flujo en Torre A en 15% para
                ahorrar 5,000L hoy. Condiciones ambientales favorables.
            </div>
            <button class="action-btn">Aplicar</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .cooling-status {
        background: var(--bg-panel);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        height: 100%;
    }

    .header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .status-badge {
        color: var(--acc-success);
        background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
        padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .towers-container {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .tower {
        flex: 1;
        min-width: 140px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 1rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .tower-visual {
        width: 80px;
        height: 80px;
        background: #2a384a;
        border-radius: 8px;
        position: relative;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }

    .fan {
        width: 60px;
        height: 10px;
        background: #555;
        position: absolute;
        top: 10px;
        left: 10px;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .fan.spin {
        animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #555 0%, #777 50%, #555 100%);
    }

    @keyframes spin {
        0% {
            transform: scaleX(1);
        }
        50% {
            transform: scaleX(0.1);
        }
        100% {
            transform: scaleX(1);
        }
    }

    .water-flow {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.5);
        transition: height 1s;
    }

    .level-80 {
        height: 80%;
    }
    .level-60 {
        height: 60%;
    }

    .tower-info {
        width: 100%;
    }

    h4 {
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .metric {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .val {
        color: var(--text-main);
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .val.warning {
        color: var(--acc-warning);
    }

    .ai-insight {
        width: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.1),
            rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1)
        );
        border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.2);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 1rem;
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .insight-icon {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .insight-text {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        line-height: 1.4;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        flex: 1;
    }

    .insight-text strong {
        color: var(--acc-primary);
    }

    .action-btn {
        background: var(--acc-primary);
        color: white;
        border: none;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        cursor: pointer;
        align-self: center;
    }

    .action-btn:hover {
        opacity: 0.9;
    }
</style>
